      "title": "Bears",
      "art": "bear"
    },
    {
      "id": "up-down",
      "text": "People say the market is up or down. Up means prices rose that day. Down means they fell.",
      "defines": [],
      "title": "Up or down",
      "art": "candles"
    },
    {
      "id": "index",
      "text": "An index is a list of stocks that shows how a group is doing. If many stocks in the list rise, the index goes up.",
      "defines": ["index"],
      "title": "Indexes",
      "art": "index"
    },
    {
      "id": "big-three",
      "text": "The S&P 500 is an index of 500 big US companies. The Dow is an index of 30 big companies. The Nasdaq has an index too.",
